# OUTPUT FORMAT

- Output a Markdown heading/list outline only. No preamble, no closing remarks, no tables, no bold.
- Structure rules:
  - Exactly one level-1 heading: the central topic (short phrase).
  - 3-6 level-2 headings: the main branches.
  - Under each branch, nested bullet lists ("- item") up to two further levels (level-3 and level-4 content as bullets).
  - Every node label is 2-12 words; prefer noun phrases. No sentences, no trailing periods.
  - At most 8 bullets per level under one parent.
- Do not invent facts that are not supported by the context.
